  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring Evaluation and Learning across the COAST programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A comprehensive Monitoring Evaluation and Learning component will support the success of COAST. KPIs will be used within the programme logframe to track output, outcome, and impact progress. COAST&#x2019;s final year will be used to consolidate MEL activities, including to complete endline evaluations.</narrative>
  </description>
